+ * retrieved using UCHAR_GENERAL_CATEGORY_MASK, not
+ * UCHAR_GENERAL_CATEGORY.  These include: "C" / "Other", "L" /
+ * "Letter", "LC" / "Cased_Letter", "M" / "Mark", "N" / "Number", "P"
+ * / "Punctuation", "S" / "Symbol", and "Z" / "Separator".
