+     *
+     * [:foo:] [:^foo:] - white space not allowed within "[:" or ":]"
+     * \\p{foo} \\P{foo}  - white space not allowed within "\\p" or "\\P"
+     * \\N{name}         - white space not allowed within "\\N"
